# civitai.red 去广告规则（Loon 远程规则订阅）
# ⚠️ 注意：远程规则订阅的策略在导入时/引用行 policy= 指定，本文件不写策略列
# 引用示例：
#   [Remote Rule]
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dranklim/loon/main/rules/civitai_ads.list, policy=REJECT, tag=civitai_ads, enabled=true
# 或推荐直接用插件：plugins/Civitai_remove_ads.plugin（策略内置，一键生效）

# ===== Snigel AdNgin 主广告引擎（核心，实测 cdn.snigelweb.com/adengine/civitai.com/loader.js 200）=====
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,snigelweb.com
# ===== Google 广告与埋点 =====
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,doubleclick.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googletagmanager.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,google-analytics.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googlesyndication.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adsbygoogle.com
# ===== AnyClip outstream 视频广告 =====
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anyclip.com
# ===== Civitai 自营广告曝光打点 =====
URL-REGEX,^https?:\/\/civitai\.red\/api\/v1\/view
URL-REGEX,^https?:\/\/civitai\.com\/api\/v1\/view
